docs {
  Positive Test Cases

  This flow targets expected user behaviour when:

  1. Registering a new Weather Station
  2. Getting the info of that station
  3. Listing all stations
  4. Making an update to that Station
  5. Sending and getting measurements
  6. Deleting the Station and confirming it is gone
}
